<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jahid Ifran | Portfolio</title>
    <style>
        /* Minimalist & High-Contrast Reset */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0b0b0b;
            color: #f5f5f5;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        /* Navigation */
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #222;
        }

        nav .logo {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin-left: 2rem;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: #999;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #fff;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        header {
            padding: 8rem 0 5rem 0;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 400;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #888;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        /* About & Origin Section */
        .about-section {
            padding: 5rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 4rem;
        }

        .about-section h2 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .about-content p {
            color: #aaa;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
        }

        /* Portfolio / Future Works Grid */
        .portfolio-section {
            padding: 5rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
        }

        .portfolio-section h2 {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 2rem;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: #121212;
            border: 1px solid #222;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
        }

        .project-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            border-color: #444;
        }

        .project-card .tag {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #666;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .project-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .project-card p {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            padding: 4rem 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
            text-align: center;
            color: #444;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Responsive Design */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .about-section {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 2rem;
            }
            header h1 {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Navigation -->
        <nav>
            <div class="logo">MJI.NAHID</div>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#works">Works</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>

        <!-- Hero Section -->
        <header>
            <h1>MD Jahid Ifran Nahid</h1>
            <p>Aspiring architect and designer focused on structural forms, spatial dynamics, and visual storytelling.</p>
        </header>

        <!-- About Section -->
        <section id="about" class="about-section">
            <div>
                <h2>Who I Am <br>& Where I'm From</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="about-content">
                <p>I am a designer driven by structural precision and clean aesthetics. My work is heavily inspired by minimalist forms, high-contrast monochrome landscapes, and the fine balance between functionality and visual art.</p>
                <p>Based in <strong>Bangladesh</strong>, a region rich in diverse landscapes and architectural evolution, I aim to merge traditional spatial understandings with sharp, contemporary digital drafting and modeling.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Portfolio Section -->
        <section id="works" class="portfolio-section">
            <h2>Selected Works</h2>
            <div class="grid">
                
                <!-- Placeholder Card 1 -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <span class="tag">Architecture / AutoCAD</span>
                    <h3>Spatial Design & Layouts</h3>
                    <p>Future space for architectural blueprints, 2D/3D floor plans, and digital structural concepts.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Placeholder Card 2 -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <span class="tag">3D Modeling</span>
                    <h3>Structural Concepts</h3>
                    <p>Future showcase for detailed scale models, perspective renders, and environmental design projects.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Placeholder Card 3 -->
                <div class="project-card">
                    <span class="tag">Photography</span>
                    <h3>Monochrome & Landscapes</h3>
                    <p>A curated look at high-contrast astrophotography, urban geometries, and natural environments.</p>
                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <footer id="contact">
            <p>&copy; 2026 MJI.NAHID. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.</p>
        </footer>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
